  "limitations": [
    "RGB thumbnails only, four samples per sequence; cannot exclude an unsampled scene change or duplicate.",
    "Raw RGB bytes, full Event streams, original ICE source directory, source inventory and official split JSON were not included; those source hashes were not independently recomputed.",
    "Receipt source_modified=false is a recorded claim. Reconstructed source-record hashes establish consistency, not examination of the original directory.",
    "Recording-session IDs and condition metadata are unverified; geographic-site or session independence is not established.",
    "Validation contains skyline and arched-hall backgrounds; it is not balanced across all environments.",
    "DJI Mini 2 source identity occurs only in proposed training; target class remains drone.",
    "Hall versus utility-corridor geographic/session relationship is unknown; proposal separates recognizable backgrounds, not certified sessions.",
    "Working split approval does not approve the loader, full training protocol or baseline run."
  ],
